  "title": "EXCLUSIVE JDM R18 Mainline",
  "description": "<p><b>Best-In-Class Strength And Suppleness, Premium, 100% Fluorocarbon Performance Fishing Line, Virtually Invisible </b></p>\n<p>R18 is Seaguar Japan’s premier fluorocarbon mainline with top-of-the-line overall performance. It delivers excellent performance in three key areas: strength, suppleness, and castability.</p>\n<p>This line was created with Seaguar’s exclusive double-structure process with two custom Seaguar 100% fluorocarbon resins to create a line with exceptional knot and tensile strength.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">It’s soft, supple and very manageable - easy casting and very smooth coming off your reel.</span></p>\n<p>They are offered on 100-meter spools which is 109 yards. Available in 4 through 20 lb. test including some unique, nontraditional sizes: 5, 7, and 14 lb. test</p>\n<p>R18 is part of the Seaguar JDM Collection — imported from Japan for tackle junkies, avid anglers and professional fishermen. The JDM Collection includes fluoro mainline, fluoro leader, and braid selections.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0646/6548/5531/files/Prop65-warning_v1_550.png?v=1780670842\" alt=\"\"></p>",
